WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:06.220
It all started in 1983 with reports of human
trafficking in the heart of Sin City.

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:10.790
The FBI had gotten word of a potential trafficking
ring operating out of an abandoned department

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:16.139
store in Las Vegas, Nevada, and immediately
began organizing a secret raid on the building.

00:00:16.139 --> 00:00:20.630
While they would indeed encounter something
horrifying within that abandoned department

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:24.130
store, it wasn’t criminals or human trafficking.

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:27.349
In fact, it wasn’t human at all.

00:00:27.349 --> 00:00:31.789
This is the horrifying story of SCP - 847.

00:00:31.789 --> 00:00:36.730
After weeks of planning, the raid on the department
store was conducted in the dead of night.

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:41.450
Agents covered all the exits and entrances
and a helicopter was stationed nearby in case

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:42.950
anyone attempted to run.

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:45.360
It should have been a perfect trap.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:49.270
But things never go as planned when you don’t
know what you’re dealing with.

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:53.060
The agents breached the door, and began searching
the darkened building.

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:57.420
It didn’t appear that there was any power,
so the traffickers must have had great night

00:00:57.420 --> 00:01:00.620
vision and a high tolerance for creepy locales.

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.470
Agents soon heard a faint humming sound coming
from below - a generator.

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:09.500
It must be located in the basement and be
the hub of this criminal enterprise.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:13.790
Readying themselves for whatever they were
about to find, the agents descended into the

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:14.790
basement.

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:19.320
As they moved deeper into the building, they
found that lighting rigs had been set up - they

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:24.040
must be getting closer to something, but that
“something” was still a mystery.

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:29.020
A senior FBI Special Agent was leading the
charge, his pistol drawn and ready.

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:30.070
It was quiet.

00:01:30.070 --> 00:01:31.079
Too quiet.

00:01:31.079 --> 00:01:34.600
Did the traffickers already realize they were
coming and clear out?

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:39.710
He was ready to consider this bust a bust
when he heard a quiet mewling in the distance.

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:44.600
A persistent, whining whimper that was undeniably
human.

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:47.570
He gave the signal to his fellow agents to
follow the noise.

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:52.500
They proceeded forward towards the pained
sounds and found themselves in a wide, well-lit

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:55.560
room filled with department store mannequins.

00:01:55.560 --> 00:02:00.729
All were broken to some degree - some were
totally smashed to pieces, some were chained

00:02:00.729 --> 00:02:05.180
to walls and locked in cages, others were
wrapped in plastic.

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:09.849
The agent wondered whether this was some kind
of twisted joke, or a messed up avant garde

00:02:09.849 --> 00:02:10.940
art piece.

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:17.030
That’s when he noticed Her: A single, crouched
figure in the distance, hunched over and whimpering

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:20.320
in a darkened corner of the room near a full-length
mirror.

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:25.310
He couldn’t fully make her out, but he got
the sense that something was wrong - she was

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:27.020
injured, bent over.

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:28.520
Was she even missing an arm?

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:31.010
Just what had these monsters done to this
woman?

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:34.590
He whispered a request for back up into his
radio, and pushed on.

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:39.650
When they got within 50 meters of the strange
woman, her demeanor changed entirely.

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:44.129
She jerked around - her movements forced,
erratic, and painful-looking.

00:02:44.129 --> 00:02:48.989
The woman stared directly into the agent’s
eyes and began hobbling towards him., occasionally

00:02:48.989 --> 00:02:53.209
stopping to strike a pose as if modelling
during a photo shoot.

00:02:53.209 --> 00:02:58.350
Just then the agent made a horrifying realization
- this thing moving towards them wasn’t

00:02:58.350 --> 00:03:02.230
a woman at all, it was a living mannequin.

00:03:02.230 --> 00:03:06.010
As she got closer though, he also realized
that the mannequin’s broken left forearm

00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:08.670
had been carved into a large shiv.

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:13.159
A female junior FBI agent had been one of
the many to pour into the room when the raid

00:03:13.159 --> 00:03:15.000
leader had radioed for backup.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:19.800
The second she entered the fifty meter range
of this strange mannequin, everything changed.

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:25.750
In an instant, its eyes and mouth began dripping
with a thick, viscous resin.

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:30.909
Its whimpering gasps suddenly became vicious,
earsplitting screeches, and it turned its

00:03:30.909 --> 00:03:32.980
gaze from the senior FBI agent.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:37.741
It was now focused on the junior agent who
had just entered the room and broke into a

00:03:37.741 --> 00:03:40.180
terrifying run straight towards her.

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:43.830
The mannequin moved with a violent, single-minded
purpose.

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:48.830
Other agents began firing but it was running
freakishly fast and easily dodged most of

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:49.830
the bullets.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:53.540
The few that actually hit seemed to do nothing
to slow the creature down.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:57.280
It shrugged off the damage and kept running.

00:03:57.280 --> 00:04:01.470
With a great leap, it landed on the terrified
junior agent, and began jabbing at her with

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:02.780
its bladed arm.

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:07.049
The other agents stopped firing, fearing they
might accidentally hit their colleague during

00:04:07.049 --> 00:04:08.049
the panic.

00:04:08.049 --> 00:04:13.310
The mannequin was ruthless, clawing and stabbing,
with the strange resin leaking out of its

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:15.170
every orifice.

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:19.190
Terrified and unable to reach her gun, the
agent remembered her training - she reached

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:23.580
into her belt and grabbed her stun gun, jamming
the two probes up against the creature’s

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:26.300
chest and giving it 30,000 volts.

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:32.139
The creature spasmed, fell backwards, and
collapsed in a heap on the ground - frozen.

00:04:32.139 --> 00:04:37.690
This was the first recorded encounter with
SCP - 847 - a violent living mannequin with

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:40.500
a serious problem with women.

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:44.550
This terrifying report was passed up the chain
of command until it landed on the desk of

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:47.000
a Foundation Agent working in the FBI.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:51.630
The Foundation quickly swooped in and claimed
the mannequin, delivered necessary amnestic

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:56.370
treatment to all who’d witnessed it, and
closely observed the female junior FBI agent’s

00:04:56.370 --> 00:05:00.050
recovery in a private hospital with Foundation
ties.

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:05.280
As it turns out, they were right to do so,
as the junior agent was in for a gruesome

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:06.280
fate.

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:11.090
While the wounds she’d suffered at the hands
of SCP - 847 didn’t appear fatal, the fact

00:05:11.090 --> 00:05:16.680
that the mannequin’s anomalous resin excretions
entered the open wound changed everything.

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:21.390
Several hours after being committed, the junior
agent began complaining of limb stiffness

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:23.210
and difficulty moving.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:26.110
This quickly developed into full paralysis.

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:32.040
Over time, her skin and internal organs began
to harden, until the process - dubbed plastination

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:34.150
- came to a gruesome end.

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:39.550
The junior agent wasn’t just dead, she had
been transformed into a mannequin.

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:44.470
Foundation researchers were met with a truly
horrifying realization - This meant that all

00:05:44.470 --> 00:05:51.270
the other broken mannequins found with SCP
- 847 were likely once living humans, attacked

00:05:51.270 --> 00:05:57.560
and transformed by the anomaly, now a source
for new harvested body parts.

00:05:57.560 --> 00:06:03.190
Now safely interred at a Foundation containment
facility though, the real tests on SCP - 847

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:07.610
to determine its behavior and physical attributes
could begin.

00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:13.470
The most important detail about SCP - 847
is that its aggression is exclusively directed

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:20.139
towards women, as opposed to when it encounters
men and its instincts are more self-destructive.

00:06:20.139 --> 00:06:24.770
Through a series of tests and observations,
researchers have been able to pin down three

00:06:24.770 --> 00:06:30.120
different distinct patterns of behavior for
SCP - 847.

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:35.189
Pattern Z behaviors occur when there are no
humans standing within fifty meters of SCP

00:06:35.189 --> 00:06:36.189
- 847.

00:06:36.189 --> 00:06:40.440
The mannequin will seek out a full length
mirror, and pose in front of it, much like

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:43.950
a department store mannequin attempting to
show off its clothes.

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:49.050
It remains largely inanimate during these
periods, and will very occasionally use a

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:54.140
finger - or whatever appendage is available,
given its habit for self-mutilation - to scratch

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:56.990
messages on nearby surfaces.

00:06:56.990 --> 00:07:02.180
Pattern Y behaviors occur when male humans
with XY chromosomes enter a fifty meter radius

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:05.180
around SCP - 847.

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:11.110
Just like its reaction to the male FBI agents
who found it, 847 will initially emit vocalizations

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:16.700
that seem like whimpering gasps, before making
eye contact and striking provocative poses

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:18.470
while approaching the subject.

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:22.870
It will then remain static, and allow the
male subject to pose its body.

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:27.810
However, after the male subject leaves the
area, 847 will enter a state of considerable

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:32.210
distress, and begin removing or shattering
parts of its body.

00:07:32.210 --> 00:07:36.400
The Foundation has found that the parts removed
or shattered are often consistent with parts

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:41.450
that the male subjects found displeasing during
interactions, showing a masochistic desire

00:07:41.450 --> 00:07:42.960
to impress.

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:46.720
These parts are then harvested back from plastinated
victims.

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:51.280
Which brings us to the most dangerous of its
behavior patterns.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:56.390
Pattern X behaviors occur when female humans
enter a 50 meter radius around the creature.

00:07:56.390 --> 00:08:01.870
847 will immediately become brutally aggressive,
switching its noises from whimpers to violent

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.460
screeches and growls.

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:09.570
847 also experiences enhanced physical capabilities
during Pattern X states - its speed has been

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:15.919
measured at 45 kilometers per hour, making
it as fast as the legendary SCP - 096.

00:08:15.919 --> 00:08:20.139
It’s also been shown to exhibit extreme
physical strength.

00:08:20.139 --> 00:08:24.931
It’s during this pattern of behavior that
it begins excreting its deadly resin, which

00:08:24.931 --> 00:08:28.180
has been proven to only be dangerous to women.

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:33.169
In these states, the only thing capable of
reliably pacifying the being is a powerful

00:08:33.169 --> 00:08:34.560
electric shock.

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:39.130
The shock causes the creature’s resin to
harden, temporarily incapacitating it for

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:41.080
roughly five minutes.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:47.589
Other conventional weapons and damage has
no meaningful effect on SCP - 847.

00:08:47.589 --> 00:08:52.130
After a number of incidents that had sad and
violent endings, the Foundation Ethics Committee

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:56.769
forbade the use of female D-Class personnel
in SCP - 847 testing.

00:08:56.769 --> 00:09:03.320
When it came to female subjects, 847 always
slipped into a state of extreme aggression,

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:08.200
so instead the Foundation began testing with
male subjects in hopes of better understanding

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:13.320
the dynamics between human males and SCP-847.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:18.420
Various misogynistic D-Class males were introduced
into the containment chamber, which was modelled

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:21.810
to look like a bedroom for the purposes of
behavioral study.

00:09:21.810 --> 00:09:28.070
Each one, either during or after their interaction
with SCP - 847, was told to comment on some

00:09:28.070 --> 00:09:30.399
aspect they felt dissatisfied with.

00:09:30.399 --> 00:09:35.520
The mannequin shattered its own chest after
hearing it described as being out of proportion.

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:39.779
After another D-Class called its nose ugly,
the mannequin broke it off.

00:09:39.779 --> 00:09:43.860
After another said that its hair was out of
fashion and commented on its inability to

00:09:43.860 --> 00:09:47.300
drink, it tore out its hair and liver.

00:09:47.300 --> 00:09:50.490
All parts were replaced after the experiments.

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:56.310
Things took their most violent and upsetting
turn yet with the introduction of D-7294.

00:09:56.310 --> 00:10:01.339
A lot of the time, D-Class personnel are considered
to be as anonymous as they are expendable.

00:10:01.339 --> 00:10:05.390
But D-7294 is an exception.

00:10:05.390 --> 00:10:09.680
Before becoming D-Class, he was a successful
cello teacher who brutally murdered one of

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:11.720
his teenage students and her mother.

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:16.200
He’s typically employed in tests when the
Foundation wishes to see interactions between

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:20.990
anomalies and humans with confirmed psychopathic
personalities.

00:10:20.990 --> 00:10:26.200
During his interaction with SCP - 847, he
belittled and humiliated the mannequin.

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:30.510
He forced it into uncomfortable poses, and
even snapped off one of its fingers before

00:10:30.510 --> 00:10:33.630
being dragged from the room by Foundation
guards.

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:38.010
In the following debrief, he further berated
the mannequin as “useless” and “lousy”

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:40.770
at its job of being controlled by him.

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:47.790
In response, 847 extracted its own brains,
eyes, and clavicle before shattering its own

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.830
hands in dismay.

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:52.170
So why does SCP - 847 behave this way?

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:57.700
While it may appear monstrous, it seems that
the reason SCP - 847 does what it does is

00:10:57.700 --> 00:11:03.970
all too human: It hurts women because it itself
is hurting, and it’s willing to hurt itself

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:07.200
even more for the approval of the objects
of its desire.

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:13.270
As a result, it’s an anomaly trapped in
an endless cycle of pain and violence.

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:18.520
Perhaps one day it’ll be able to free itself
from the loop, but that day is unlikely to

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:22.089
come for this murderous mannequin anytime
soon.

00:11:22.089 --> 00:11:29.310
Now go check out “SCP - 035 - The Possessive
Mask” and “SCP - 2935 - O, Death” for

00:11:29.310 --> 00:11:32.180
more chilling stories from the SCP Foundation!

